pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# #488 gate: enter PHOTO MODE as fh1-photo-mode does, then drive the photo
# camera down and in with the sticks and triggers. Run it twice, with and
# without --pinyon_shift_photo_camera_through_walls=true: with the flag the
# camera ends inside or under the terrain, without it the camera stops at
# the ground and the captures differ.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 900 free-roam
input 960 0010 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 966 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1020 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1026 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1050 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1056 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1080 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1086 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1260 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1266 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1440 photo-camera
input 1460 0000 0 0 0 0 0 -32767
input 1700 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1720 right-down
input 1740 0000 0 0 0 -32767 0 0
input 1980 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2000 left-down
input 2020 0000 255 0 0 0 0 0
input 2260 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2280 left-trigger
input 2300 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
input 2540 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2560 right-trigger
stop 2600
